---
source: misc/tests/help.rs
expression: "help_output(\"mcookie\")"
---
Generate magic cookies for xauth.

Generates a 128-bit random hexadecimal number for use with the X authority system.

Usage: mcookie [OPTIONS]

Options:
  -f, --file <FILE>
          Use this file as an additional source of randomness. When file is '-', characters are read
          from standard input

  -m, --max-size <MAX_SIZE>
          Read from file only this number of bytes

  -v, --verbose
          Inform where randomness originated

  -h, --help
          Print help (see a summary with '-h')

  -V, --version
          Print version
